# The server image builds Go sources only (see Dockerfile.server). Without
# this file Docker uploads the whole tree as build context -- measured at
# 614MB, of which sites/ is 782MB on disk and node_modules/ 583MB, none of
# it reachable from cmd/agent-comms-server.
#
# Keep in mind when editing: Dockerfile.server does `COPY . .` after the
# dependency layer, so anything excluded here is absent from the build.
# go.mod's local replace directives need third_party/, and the two
# //go:embed directives (internal/authority/schema.sql,
# internal/onboarding/decision_tree.tmpl) sit beside their Go files in
# internal/ -- do not exclude any of those.

# Version control and local agent state
.git
.gitignore
.worktrees
.agent-comms
.claude
.superpowers

# JavaScript workspaces: the landing site, the docs site, and their deps
sites
node_modules
**/node_modules
package-lock.json

# Build, test and scratch output
output
dist
**/.next
**/test-results
**/playwright-report
agent-comms-fresh

# Documentation and CI config, none of it compiled into the binary
docs
.github
*.md
LICENSE

# Container definitions themselves
Dockerfile*
compose.yaml
.dockerignore
